GIMP Palette
Name: BLHS Tropical Master
Columns: 8
# Tropical-TavernWorld master ramp. Everything in the game conforms to THIS so the
# world shares one hand. Shadows are teal-tinted (never neutral gray); rock is warm.
# Starting point sampled from the TavernWorld gold-standard + the tropical targets;
# refine with eyes / Lospec, then re-conform. Also importable into Aseprite.
